218
00:17:07,328 --> 00:17:10,564
The last time frame participant and the most

219
00:17:10,564 --> 00:17:12,991
influential time frame participant is the

220
00:17:12,991 --> 00:17:16,227
long term investor, also known as paper traders.

221
00:17:17,028 --> 00:17:19,828
First and foremost, they're not price sensitive.

222
00:17:21,328 --> 00:17:27,528
Paper traders tend to focus heavily on the fundamentals, giving more attention to the fundamentals than the technicals.

223
00:17:28,128 --> 00:17:33,928
When they're active, they tend to have very large orders and they're quite visible to the market, these orders.

224
00:17:34,428 --> 00:17:35,724
More importantly, these orders

225
00:17:35,724 --> 00:17:38,316
