320
00:24:28,272 --> 00:24:30,672
Price advertises the opportunity.

321
00:24:31,372 --> 00:24:33,872
Time regulates each opportunity.

322
00:24:34,072 --> 00:24:37,772
And volume measures the degree of success of each auction.

323
00:24:38,672 --> 00:24:42,072
This is the key fundamental pillars behind auctions.

324
00:24:42,472 --> 00:24:49,667
